            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Hadi Elzayn, Emily Black, Patrick Vossler, Nathanael Jo, Jacob Goldin & Daniel E. Ho, Estimating and Implementing Conventional Fairness Metrics With Probabilistic Protected Features, 2024 IEEE Conf. Secure & Trustworthy Mach. Learning 161. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at https://purl.stanford.edu/bh131td4896. https://doi.org/10.25740/bh131td4896.",
            "type": "preferred citation",
            "identifier": [],
